[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: MIL-STD-498 SDP (Software Development Plan)

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SDP-001
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Development Process
STATEMENT: The project shall follow agile development methodology with iterative delivery and continuous feedback.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SDP-002
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Quality Assurance
STATEMENT: The project shall implement comprehensive quality assurance processes including code reviews and testing.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SDP-003
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Risk Management
STATEMENT: The project shall identify and mitigate risks through proactive planning and monitoring.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SDP-004
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Communication Plan
STATEMENT: The project shall maintain regular communication with stakeholders through status reports and meetings.
RATIONALE: This requirement ensures proper system functionality and compliance with standards.